  {
    "RowId": 46590,
    "Description": "Creates a barrier around self or target party member that absorbs damage equivalent to 20% of the caster's maximum HP.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>60s\nWhen the barrier is completely absorbed, grants <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Honed Spellblade</span> to the caster.<If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(108),2))>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Honed Spellblade Effect: </span>Increases damage dealt by next Spellblade\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>30s<Else/> </If>"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 46591,
    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 200.\n<If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(108),2))><span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Honed Spellblade Potency: </span>300\n<Else/> </If>Potency scales with item level.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span>20% chance to <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Petrify</span> target\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Petrify Effect: </span>Incapacitated upon taking damage\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>10s<If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(108),3))>\nShares a recast timer with <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Holy Spellblade</span><If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(108),4))> and <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Blazing Spellblade</span><Else/> </If>.<Else/> </If>"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 46592,
    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 300.\nPotency increases to 500 when used against undead enemies.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Honed Spellblade Potency: </span>400\nSpellblade potency increases to 600 when used against undead enemies.\nPotency scales with item level.\nShares a recast timer with <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Sundering Spellblade</span><If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(108),4))> and <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Blazing Spellblade</span><Else/> </If>."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 46593,
    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 200.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Honed Spellblade Potency: </span>300\nPotency scales with item level.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span>Increases target's damage taken by 5%\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>70s\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span>Increases damage dealt by 5%\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>70s\nShares a recast timer with <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Sundering Spellblade</span> and <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Holy Spellblade</span>."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 46594,
    "Description": "Delivers an attack to target.\n60% chance for an attack with a potency of 600<If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(108),2))>, the chance increasing by 15% for every stack of <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Finishing Fervor</span><Else/> </If>.\n20% chance for an attack with a potency of 1,000 potency<If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(108),2))>, the chance increasing by 20% for every stack of <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Finishing Fervor</span><Else/> </If>.\n20% chance for your attack to miss<If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(108),2))>, the chance decreasing by 5% for every stack of <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Finishing Fervor</span><Else/> </If>.\nPotency scales with item level.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span>25% chance to kill target instantly, with some exceptions."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 46595,
    "Description": "Reduces damage taken by 50%.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>5s\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span>Grants a stack of <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Finishing Fervor</span> upon taking reduced damage\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Maximum Stacks: </span>4\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>120s\nRemoves a stack of <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Finishing Fervor</span> upon taking damage when the action is not on cooldown."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 46596,
    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 400.\nPotency scales with item level."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 46597,
    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 600 to all nearby enemies.\nPotency scales with item level."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 46598,
    "Description": "Grants <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Poised to Sword Dance</span>, <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Tempted to Tango</span>, <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Jitterbugged</span>, or <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Willing to Waltz</span>, allowing the execution of an action depending on the effect granted.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Phantom Sword Dance Effect: </span>Delivers an attack with high potency\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Tempting Tango Effect: </span>Deals unaspected damage and freezes time\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Jitterbug Effect: </span>Deals unaspected damage, absorbing a portion of damage dealt as HP, and afflicts target with <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Paralysis</span>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Mystery Waltz Effect: </span>Deals unaspected damage, afflicts target with <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Blind</span>, and restores MP"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 46599,
    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 600.\nPotency scales with item level."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 46600,
    "Description": "Deals unaspected damage with a potency of 400.\nPotency scales with item level.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span>Freezes time\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>8s"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 46601,
    "Description": "Deals unaspected damage with a potency of 400.\nPotency scales with item level.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span>Absorbs a portion of damage dealt as HP\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span><span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Paralysis</span>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>30s"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 46602,
    "Description": "Deals unaspected damage with a potency of 400.\nPotency scales with item level.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span>Restores MP\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span><span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Blind</span>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>30s"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 46603,
    "Description": "Increases evasion by 20%.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>90s\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span>Grants <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Quicker Step</span> to self and nearby party members when executed within proximity of a knowledge crystal\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Quicker Step Effect: </span>Increases damage dealt by 2%\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>30m"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 46604,
    "Description": "Grants <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Steadfast Stance</span>.\nWhen targeting a party member, rush to their side, granting both you and the target <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Steadfast Stance</span>.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Steadfast Stance Effect:</span> Grants a barrier that absorbs damage equal to 10% of maximum HP\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 30s"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 46605,
    "Description": "Afflicts target with <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Enamored</span>, reducing damage dealt by 40%.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>4s\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span>Afflicts target with <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Mesmerized</span>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Mesmerized Effect: </span>Reduces damage dealt by 10% and increases damage taken by 5%\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>100s\nEffect cannot be stacked with Phantom Cannoneer's <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Silver Sickness</span>."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 46606,
    "Description": "When executed near a knowledge crystal, grants an effect to self and nearby party members based on your phantom job and its level.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Phantom Knight Effect (Level 2 or Higher): </span>Grants <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Enduring Fortitude</span>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Enduring Fortitude Effect: </span>Reduces damage taken by 10%\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>30m\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Phantom Monk Effect (Level 3 or Higher): </span>Grants <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Fleetfooted</span>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Fleetfooted Effect: </span>Increases movement speed\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>30m\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Phantom Bard Effect (Level 2 or Higher): </span>Grants <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Romeo's Ballad</span>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Romeo's Ballad Effect: </span>Increases Phantom EXP earned through battle by 10%\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>30m\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Phantom Dancer Effect (Level 2 or Higher): </span>Grants <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Quicker Step</span>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Swiftstrike Effect: </span>Increases damage dealt by 2%\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>30m"
  },
